---
title: "C17 — Form submit and recovery · Implemented"
---
flowchart TD
  Edit[Controlled input] --> RHF[RHF values, touched state and dirty fields]
  RHF --> Zod{Shared or domain Zod validation}
  Zod -->|Invalid| Inline[Field errors and focus; no request]
  Zod -->|Valid| Mutation[Generated mutation with expected version]
  Mutation --> Server{Authoritative response valid?}
  Server -->|Yes| Reset[Update baseline and clear saved dirty state]
  Reset --> Success[One success notification]
  Server -->|Validation or request error| Repair[Preserve draft; map field paths when present]
  Server -->|Version or config conflict, invalid response| Conflict[Retain draft; offer explicit reload]
  Repair --> Error[One error notification plus repair controls]
  Conflict --> Error
  Error --> Edit
